      "description": "An ==LLM-driven watchlist analyser for several stock markets== (mainland China, Hong Kong, US, Japan, Korea, Taiwan). It pulls quotes, indicators and news, writes a daily decision dashboard and pushes it to WeChat Work, Feishu, Telegram, Discord, Slack or email.",
      "why_interesting": "First time on our list. It is a complete, inspectable example of a scheduled LLM pipeline that ==runs free on GitHub Actions== from a fork with repository secrets. v3.34.0 (9 November) refreshes default models and stops Market Light scoring from treating a rising VIX as a rising market.",
      "caveat": "The README's own disclaimer says it is for study and research and ==is not investment advice==. Free data sources are rate-limited and unstable, model and news-search keys may cost money, and the README promotes sponsored model resellers. Its README is mainly in Chinese, with an English version under docs. We did not install it."
    }
